  "provenance": [
    "Native flows use the debug smoke build. A subsequent rebuild only reformatted JavaScript; the tested behavior is unchanged.",
    "The first reflow run exposed a test setup issue: selecting source text can replace the GTK editor primary selection on X11. The regression compares notebook state immediately before and after capture. All final checks pass.",
    "Earlier September evidence remains historical; this record does not assert those measurements were rerun."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The Docker host prohibits unprivileged user namespaces. Native tests set WEBKIT_DISABLE_SANDBOX_THIS_IS_DANGEROUS=1 inside this disposable isolated container; these runs do not qualify the WebKit sandbox. No application sandbox setting changed.",
    "AT-SPI assertions are tree/action checks, not a human Orca usability session.",
    "No system installation, actual user-session actions, Wayland scale/performance requalification, or full MVP release qualification was performed. The documented ordinary-reading, human accessibility, and performance gates remain open."
  ]
